## VGIS
A Spatial Management Perspective for Digital Oilfields.


### What VGIS Changes
before:
- Isolated systems. Isolated systems operating independently without integration
- Disconnected Dashbaords. Multiple separate views without unified context
- Limited Visibility Across Funtions. limited visibility to individual functions,missing the big picture

after:
- Unified Spatial Layer. Everything connected through a single spatial framework
- Data Anchroed to Physical Assets. Wells,piplelines,facilities all linked to real-world locations
- Operational Awareness Across Domains: Cross-domain visibility across production,integrity,safety, logistics and etc.